Z||000000||superXmotorsports||01-06-2000||11:39 PM||||Tom pointed out to me that there was a Fiero gauge offer on eBay.  I had one customer tell me about them and that they were simply stickers that you put on over the original gauge.  This dosen't allow for proper backlighting or the ability to change the color of the backlighting.  If someone buys these stickers and thinks they're great please post your findings I would like to know.  I had to buy ALOT of the sets I'm offering to sell them at the price I offered the forum members.  Thanks to you who made that possible.  Just some FYI.  Thanks! SXM.<BR>||||reg||4
